### Login para obter o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40001/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### InsertPiquete
POST http://localhost:40001/insertPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete Teste",
    "latitude": -20.4200,
    "longitude": -49.9700,
    "pastoidfk": 1
}

### GetAllPiquete
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetPiqueteByID
GET http://localhost:40001/getPiqueteByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### UpdatePiquete
PUT http://localhost:40001/updatePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Piquete Teste Alterado",
    "latitude": -20.4300,
    "longitude": -49.9800,
    "pastoidfk": 1
}

### DeletePiquete (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:40001/deletePiquete/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAllPiquete depois do delete (o registro removido não deve aparecer)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPiquete HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Teste sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPiquete HTTP/1.1
